Scope. This licence covers the data files in these directories:

  judge_scores/   LLM judge scores per paper, six models, by venue
  reference/      expected pipeline outputs: per-paper metrics, per-year
                  series, analysis tables, statistics computed from citation
                  counts, and the TMLR paper's macro files and generated
                  tables
  baselines/      per-year arXiv and PubMed aggregates and pooled acronym
                  frequency histograms

data/ is not distributed. It holds what a local run of the pipeline
generates.

Exclusions. This licence does not cover:

  - the source records the metrics were computed from: the titles,
    abstracts and metadata of NeurIPS, ICLR, ICML, arXiv and PubMed papers.
    None is distributed in this repository. They remain with their authors
    and publishers and under the terms of the services that provide them;
  - third-party citation and reference counts (Semantic Scholar, OpenAlex).
    Neither the per-paper counts nor any statistic computed from them is
    distributed.

Attribution for the sources is given in README.md and baselines/README.md.
